  "description": "My favorite idol sang in front of me?! \n\nA neighbor who when she went to throw the trash at the recycling center met Jeon Jinseol, an idol member of the 5-member boy group Blue Black!! It's been three years since that meeting, but Won Yeonwon, a steamy fan who recognized him at a glance, was captivated by the desire to see him more on stage and started a YouTube channel full of truth and fan love that she had been hiding for a while... \n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
